Defects found:

- **Idempotency guard satisfied by comment/marker**: line 84, via line 33.  
  Exact input: `<head><!-- TODO: add <meta name="description" content=""> --><title>Finerenone kidney outcome dashboard for chronic kidney disease</title></head>`  
  Consequence: the page has no real meta description, but `patch_meta_description()` returns `False` because the regex matches inside the comment.

- **Selector keyed to one meta attribute order**: line 33.  
  Exact input: `<head><meta content="Existing description" name="description"><title>Finerenone kidney outcome dashboard for chronic kidney disease</title></head>`  
  Consequence: the existing description is missed and line 96 inserts a duplicate meta description.

- **Selector keyed to lowercase `</head>`**: lines 94 and 96.  
  Exact input: `<HTML><HEAD><TITLE>Finerenone kidney outcome dashboard for chronic kidney disease</TITLE></HEAD><BODY></BODY></HTML>`  
  Consequence: valid HTML with uppercase `</HEAD>` is skipped, despite `HEAD_END_RE` being case-insensitive and unused.

- **Selector/count mismatch in PICO handling**: lines 53 and 56.  
  Exact input: `pop: 'adults with chronic kidney disease'; int: 'mineralocorticoid receptor antagonist'; comp: 'placebo comparator'; cond: 'type 2 diabetes'; drug: 'finerenone'; out: 'kidney failure outcomes'`  
  Consequence: `comp` counts toward the four-field stop but is never emitted, so later `drug` and `out` are never read.

- **Selector rejects/truncates apostrophe-containing PICO values**: line 29.  
  Exact input: `drug: 'finerenone'; cond: 'Alzheimer's disease population'; pop: 'adults with chronic kidney disease'; out: 'kidney failure outcome'`  
  Consequence: `cond` is captured as `Alzheimer`, producing a false truncated description.

- **Unescaped sitemap location**: lines 121 and 123.  
  Exact input: repo-root file named `a&b.html`.  
  Consequence: sitemap emits `<loc>.../a&b.html</loc>`, which is invalid XML and not URL-safe.

No proven defect found for: probe keyed to string a fix removes; different-copy instrumentation; CRLF/LF text comparison; merged-cell tabulation; zero conflated with absent; negation dropped; wrapper status code.  
COULD NOT DETERMINE corpus-wide selector coverage without the actual repo-root HTML corpus.
